          "Record who released the dependent action and when. Use the same definition across the queue and the review so the counts agree. Separate a data conflict from a policy conflict. Check whether the exception came from a form, a rule, or a permission. The rejection appeal documentation close note cites the collections file, the approver, and the time of the final check. A rejection appeal documentation handoff at Legal Billing Assistant ends only when the next billing reviewer can act from the written record."
